          <ATTRIBUTES>
            <ATT name="Name"><![CDATA[019b5920-7db9-4bf8-8954-032fccc94563]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagGroup=infrastructure
graphRagExtractionHints=Nodes appear in 'Infrastructure technique', 'Physical Architecture', 'Deployment Diagram', 'Network Diagram', sizing tables ('dimensionnement'\: CPU / RAM / disque per server) and standards catalogs ('Server Hardware\: HPE Proliant', 'Core/Peripheral Switch\: Cisco Nexus'). Use the role or hostname as name; the product goes to technology. Do not create a node for a product that is only listed as a standard without an instance.
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
          </ATTRIBUTES>
          <DEPENDENCIES>
