          <ATTRIBUTES>
            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[A piece of infrastructure that hosts or connects components: a physical or virtual server, a mainframe, a cluster node, a network device (core switch, firewall, wireless access point), a storage array, an appliance (UPS, backup appliance), a cloud instance or an end-user device model. Named by its hostname, role or model as printed.]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="MimeType"><![CDATA[text/plain]]></ATT>
